    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(3rd Level)</em></p><p>You anchor manifestations to declared metaphors.</p><p>When you cast illusion or enchantment, you may declare a symbolic anchor:</p><ul><li><p>Crown</p></li><li><p>Chain</p></li><li><p>Mirror</p></li><li><p>Storm</p></li><li><p>Fire</p></li><li><p>Mask</p></li><li><p>Hunt</p></li><li><p>Etc.</p></li></ul><p>If the metaphor is meaningfully relevant in the scene:</p><ul><li><p>Bank Surge.</p></li></ul><p>If the metaphor is contradicted:</p><ul><li><p>Immediately gain misfire risk.</p></li></ul><p>This is not flavor.</p><p>The metaphor must be maintained.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
